quirements Regulations, 2015. Annexures detailing the event and the resignation letter are enclosed with the notice.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/SGLOBAL_10112026183601_reg30smpresignsigned.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "07-Nov-2026 13:09:08", "attFileSize": "6.71 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SGLOBAL_07112026130803_newspublicationcoversigned.pdf", "attchmntText": "Signatureglobal (India) Limited has informed the Exchange about Copy of Newspaper Publication", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Copy of Newspaper Publication", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "07112026130908", "exchdisstime": "07-Nov-2026 13:09:09", "fileSize": "6.71 MB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106852185", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE903U01023", "sm_name": "Signatureglobal (India) Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-07 13:09:08", "symbol": "SIGNATURE", "voiceSummary": "Signatureglobal India Limited published newspaper advertisements on 7th November 2026 regarding its Unaudited Financial Results for the quarter and half year ended 30th September 2026. The Board of Directors approved these Consolidated Financial Results on 5th November 2026. The results were subjected to a limited review by statutory auditors. Valiant Organics Limited and Globalspace Technologies Limited also approved their Unaudited Financial Results for the same period on 5th November 2026. JSW Paints Limited approved its Unaudited Standalone Financial Results on 6th November 2026. Jiya Eco-Products Limited reported a Net Loss of 11.92 Lakhs for the quarter ended 30th September 2026. Autoline Industries Limited reported a Net Profit of 595 Lakhs for the quarter ended 30th September 2026.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/SGLOBAL_07112026130803_newspublicationcoversigned.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "06-Nov-2026 09:14:39", "attFileSize": "1.01 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SGLOBAL_06112026091334_O